# MLB Squares (#005)

Second **flagship** experience — not NFL copy. Daily baseball engagement, learn in <60 seconds.

## Winning checkpoints

End of 3rd · 5th · 7th inning + Final. Last digit of each team's score.

## No Wait Line

Spawn next board at **85%** capacity — never "Board Full."

## Automation

Daily schedule import → boards → live sync → winners → payouts → legacy/XP/activity.

## Marketplace

⚾ MLB Squares equal weight beside 🏈 NFL Squares.

## Extend (don't fork)

Inning periods via `lib/espn/sports.ts` + scoring engine. Hook stats/legacy via platform adapter.

Full spec: `docs/MLB_SQUARES_EXPERIENCE.md`
